---
One screen: projects, device health, open anomalies, unread messages and
what needs attention.

Usage: hn status [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn status
  hn status --json | jq .devices
